{"id":"e0bca8961c66270c","group":"58","path":"58/batch04/58-thm-itokobayashi.md","title":"Itô Formula","display":"thm-itokobayashi — Itô Formula","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-itokobayashi","aliases":["58-thm-itokobayashi"],"display":"thm-itokobayashi — Itô Formula","depends_on":["[[../batch14/58-df-brownian-motion.md]]","[[58-df-adapted.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch03/58-df-stochastic-integral-data.md]]","[[../batch11/58-df-predictable.md]]","[[../batch07/58-df-zfc-prob-brownian-motion-process.md]]","[[../batch15/58-df-derivative.md]]","[[../batch08/58-df-sigma-generated.md]]","[[../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-itokobayashi"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-itokobayashi</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-itokobayashi — Itô Formula"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"948f8f3178040b74\" href=\"?note=948f8f3178040b74\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-brownian-motion.md\">../batch14/58-df-brownian-motion.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6493b2eeaa7f968f\" href=\"?note=6493b2eeaa7f968f\" title=\"58-df-adapted.md\">58-df-adapted.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b91a21e76d0947e0\" href=\"?note=b91a21e76d0947e0\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-stochastic-integral-data.md\">../batch03/58-df-stochastic-integral-data.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"7934599233a4e10f\" href=\"?note=7934599233a4e10f\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-predictable.md\">../batch11/58-df-predictable.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"a8a0a7253619eec2\" href=\"?note=a8a0a7253619eec2\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-zfc-prob-brownian-motion-process.md\">../batch07/58-df-zfc-prob-brownian-motion-process.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"6ad876d2c15e685f\" href=\"?note=6ad876d2c15e685f\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-derivative.md\">../batch15/58-df-derivative.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"e03c77e7d23896d9\" href=\"?note=e03c77e7d23896d9\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-sigma-generated.md\">../batch08/58-df-sigma-generated.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"bbbec05fde1d3b01\" href=\"?note=bbbec05fde1d3b01\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md\">../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T=\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\">\\(T=\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B,X,\\mu,\\sigma,f,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,t\\in V\">\\(B,X,\\mu,\\sigma,f,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,t\\in V\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>过程采用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\to\\mathbb R^\\Omega\">\\(T\\to\\mathbb R^\\Omega\\)</span> 的编码；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X_s(w)=X(s)(w)\">\\(X_s(w)=X(s)(w)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\widehat H=\\mathrm{JointProcessGraph}_S(H,\\Omega)\">\\(\\widehat H=\\mathrm{JointProcessGraph}_S(H,\\Omega)\\)</span> 是相应的有序对函数图。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B_T=\\{A\\cap T:A\\in\\mathcal B_{\\mathbb R}\\}\">\\(\\mathcal B_T=\\{A\\cap T:A\\in\\mathcal B_{\\mathbb R}\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B_T\\otimes\\mathcal F=\\sigma_{T\\times\\Omega}(\\{A\\times E:A\\in\\mathcal B_T\\land E\\in\\mathcal F\\})\">\\(\\mathcal B_T\\otimes\\mathcal F=\\sigma_{T\\times\\Omega}(\\{A\\times E:A\\in\\mathcal B_T\\land E\\in\\mathcal F\\})\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B_{\\mathbb R},\\lambda_t\">\\(\\mathcal B_{\\mathbb R},\\lambda_t\\)</span> 取自 <code>58-df-stochastic-integral-data</code>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TwiceContinuouslyDifferentiable}_S(f)\">\\(\\mathrm{TwiceContinuouslyDifferentiable}_S(f)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f&#39;=D(f)\">\\(f&#39;=D(f)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f&#39;&#39;=D(D(f))\">\\(f&#39;&#39;=D(D(f))\\)</span>；以下组合均是函数图：\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H_1=\\{\\langle s,\\{\\langle w,f&#39;(X_s(w))\\mu_s(w)\\rangle:w\\in\\Omega\\}\\rangle:s\\in T\\}\">\\(H_1=\\{\\langle s,\\{\\langle w,f&#39;(X_s(w))\\mu_s(w)\\rangle:w\\in\\Omega\\}\\rangle:s\\in T\\}\\)</span>，\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H_2=\\{\\langle s,\\{\\langle w,f&#39;(X_s(w))\\sigma_s(w)\\rangle:w\\in\\Omega\\}\\rangle:s\\in T\\}\">\\(H_2=\\{\\langle s,\\{\\langle w,f&#39;(X_s(w))\\sigma_s(w)\\rangle:w\\in\\Omega\\}\\rangle:s\\in T\\}\\)</span>，\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H_3=\\{\\langle s,\\{\\langle w,f&#39;&#39;(X_s(w))\\sigma_s(w)^2\\rangle:w\\in\\Omega\\}\\rangle:s\\in T\\}\">\\(H_3=\\{\\langle s,\\{\\langle w,f&#39;&#39;(X_s(w))\\sigma_s(w)^2\\rangle:w\\in\\Omega\\}\\rangle:s\\in T\\}\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>下列下标为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\">\\(t\\)</span> 的两个原接口保留不变；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DyadicStep}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{DyadicStep}_S\\)</span> 的定义域为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega,t\\in T,H\\in(\\mathbb R^\\Omega)^T\">\\(n\\in\\omega,t\\in T,H\\in(\\mathbb R^\\Omega)^T\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DyadicBrownianSum}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{DyadicBrownianSum}_S\\)</span> 还要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\in(\\mathbb R^\\Omega)^T\">\\(B\\in(\\mathbb R^\\Omega)^T\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ItoDyadicIntegral}_t\">\\(\\operatorname{ItoDyadicIntegral}_t\\)</span> 的五元接口相对于本 Hypothesis 固定的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F\">\\(\\mathcal F\\)</span> 使用。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BrownianWithFiltration}\">\\(\\mathrm{BrownianWithFiltration}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PathwiseTimeIntegral}\">\\(\\mathrm{PathwiseTimeIntegral}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RandomSquareNormValue}\">\\(\\mathrm{RandomSquareNormValue}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RealRandomVariable}\">\\(\\mathrm{RealRandomVariable}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TimeIntegralValue}\">\\(\\mathrm{TimeIntegralValue}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TimeSquareNormValue}\">\\(\\mathrm{TimeSquareNormValue}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"b91a21e76d0947e0\" href=\"?note=b91a21e76d0947e0\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-stochastic-integral-data.md\">../batch03/58-df-stochastic-integral-data.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Adapted}\">\\(\\mathrm{Adapted}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"6493b2eeaa7f968f\" href=\"?note=6493b2eeaa7f968f\" title=\"58-df-adapted.md\">58-df-adapted.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Measurable}\">\\(\\mathrm{Measurable}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"bbbec05fde1d3b01\" href=\"?note=bbbec05fde1d3b01\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md\">../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ContinuousPath}\">\\(\\mathrm{ContinuousPath}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"a8a0a7253619eec2\" href=\"?note=a8a0a7253619eec2\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-zfc-prob-brownian-motion-process.md\">../batch07/58-df-zfc-prob-brownian-motion-process.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Predictable}\">\\(\\mathrm{Predictable}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"7934599233a4e10f\" href=\"?note=7934599233a4e10f\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-predictable.md\">../batch11/58-df-predictable.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DyadicLTwoApproximation}\">\\(\\mathrm{DyadicLTwoApproximation}\\)</span> 为本原子在下式引入、量化绑定或仅作层级/排版标签的记号；其参数次序与适用域由相应公式固定，不作为额外的未声明外部对象。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{DyadicStep}_S(n,t,H,\\Omega)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\\left\\langle\\langle s,w\\rangle,\n\\sum_{k&lt;2^n}H\\!\\left(\\frac{kt}{2^n}\\right)(w)\n\\mathbf1_{(kt/2^n,(k+1)t/2^n]}(s)\\right\\rangle:s\\in T\\land w\\in\\Omega\\right\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{DyadicStep}_S(n,t,H,\\Omega)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\\left\\langle\\langle s,w\\rangle,\n\\sum_{k&lt;2^n}H\\!\\left(\\frac{kt}{2^n}\\right)(w)\n\\mathbf1_{(kt/2^n,(k+1)t/2^n]}(s)\\right\\rangle:s\\in T\\land w\\in\\Omega\\right\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{DyadicBrownianSum}_S(n,t,H,B,\\Omega)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\\left\\langle w,\\sum_{k&lt;2^n}H\\!\\left(\\frac{kt}{2^n}\\right)(w)\n\\left[B\\!\\left(\\frac{(k+1)t}{2^n}\\right)(w)-B\\!\\left(\\frac{kt}{2^n}\\right)(w)\\right]\\right\\rangle:w\\in\\Omega\\right\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{DyadicBrownianSum}_S(n,t,H,B,\\Omega)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\\left\\langle w,\\sum_{k&lt;2^n}H\\!\\left(\\frac{kt}{2^n}\\right)(w)\n\\left[B\\!\\left(\\frac{(k+1)t}{2^n}\\right)(w)-B\\!\\left(\\frac{kt}{2^n}\\right)(w)\\right]\\right\\rangle:w\\in\\Omega\\right\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PathIntegral}_t(I,H,\\Omega)\n\\leftrightarrow t\\in T\\land\\mathrm{Function}(H,T,\\mathbb R^\\Omega)\n\\land\\mathrm{PathwiseTimeIntegral}_S(I,\\widehat H,t,\\Omega).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PathIntegral}_t(I,H,\\Omega)\n\\leftrightarrow t\\in T\\land\\mathrm{Function}(H,T,\\mathbb R^\\Omega)\n\\land\\mathrm{PathwiseTimeIntegral}_S(I,\\widehat H,t,\\Omega).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{ItoDyadicIntegral}_t(J,H,B,\\Omega,\\mathbb P)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;t\\in T\\land\\operatorname{ProbabilitySpace}(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(H,T,\\mathbb R^\\Omega)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(B,T,\\mathbb R^\\Omega)\n\\land\\mathrm{RealRandomVariable}_S(J,\\Omega,\\mathcal F)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists N\\in\\omega\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\setminus N\\;\n\\exists r\\in[0,\\varepsilon)\\;\\mathrm{RandomSquareNormValue}_S\\left(r,\n\\{\\langle w,J(w)-\\mathrm{DyadicBrownianSum}_S(n,t,H,B,\\Omega)(w)\\rangle:w\\in\\Omega\\},\n\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{ItoDyadicIntegral}_t(J,H,B,\\Omega,\\mathbb P)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;t\\in T\\land\\operatorname{ProbabilitySpace}(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(H,T,\\mathbb R^\\Omega)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(B,T,\\mathbb R^\\Omega)\n\\land\\mathrm{RealRandomVariable}_S(J,\\Omega,\\mathcal F)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists N\\in\\omega\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\setminus N\\;\n\\exists r\\in[0,\\varepsilon)\\;\\mathrm{RandomSquareNormValue}_S\\left(r,\n\\{\\langle w,J(w)-\\mathrm{DyadicBrownianSum}_S(n,t,H,B,\\Omega)(w)\\rangle:w\\in\\Omega\\},\n\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{DyadicLTwoApproximation}_S(H,t,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;t\\in T\\land\\mathrm{Function}(H,T,\\mathbb R^\\Omega)\n\\land\\forall s\\in T\\;\\mathrm{RealRandomVariable}_S(H(s),\\Omega,\\mathcal F)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists r\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\;\\mathrm{TimeSquareNormValue}_S(r,\\widehat H,t,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists N\\in\\omega\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\setminus N\\;\n\\exists r\\in[0,\\varepsilon)\\;\\mathrm{TimeSquareNormValue}_S\\left(r,\n\\{\\langle\\langle s,w\\rangle,\\mathrm{DyadicStep}_S(n,t,H,\\Omega)(\\langle s,w\\rangle)-H(s)(w)\\rangle:\ns\\in T\\land w\\in\\Omega\\},t,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{DyadicLTwoApproximation}_S(H,t,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;t\\in T\\land\\mathrm{Function}(H,T,\\mathbb R^\\Omega)\n\\land\\forall s\\in T\\;\\mathrm{RealRandomVariable}_S(H(s),\\Omega,\\mathcal F)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists r\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\;\\mathrm{TimeSquareNormValue}_S(r,\\widehat H,t,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists N\\in\\omega\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\setminus N\\;\n\\exists r\\in[0,\\varepsilon)\\;\\mathrm{TimeSquareNormValue}_S\\left(r,\n\\{\\langle\\langle s,w\\rangle,\\mathrm{DyadicStep}_S(n,t,H,\\Omega)(\\langle s,w\\rangle)-H(s)(w)\\rangle:\ns\\in T\\land w\\in\\Omega\\},t,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}itokobayashi}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{BrownianWithFiltration}_S(B,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,\\mathbb P)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(X,T,\\mathbb R^\\Omega)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\mu,T,\\mathbb R^\\Omega)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\sigma,T,\\mathbb R^\\Omega)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Adapted}_S(X,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,T,\\Omega)\n\\land\\mathrm{Adapted}_S(\\mu,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,T,\\Omega)\n\\land\\mathrm{Adapted}_S(\\sigma,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,T,\\Omega)\n\\land\\forall w\\in\\Omega\\;\\mathrm{ContinuousPath}_S(X,w)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{TwiceContinuouslyDifferentiable}_S(f)\n\\land\\mathrm{Measurable}_S(\\widehat\\mu;(T\\times\\Omega,\\mathcal B_T\\otimes\\mathcal F),(\\mathbb R,\\mathcal B_{\\mathbb R}))\n\\land\\mathrm{Predictable}_S(\\widehat\\sigma,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb R,\\mathcal B_{\\mathbb R})\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall t\\in T\\;\\Bigl[\n\\mathrm{DyadicLTwoApproximation}_S(\\sigma,t,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\n\\land\\mathrm{DyadicLTwoApproximation}_S(H_2,t,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall w\\in\\Omega\\;\\exists a\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\;\n\\mathrm{TimeIntegralValue}_S\\!\\left(a,\\{\\langle s,\\sigma_s(w)^2\\rangle:s\\in[0,t]\\},t\\right)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\exists I_\\mu,I_\\sigma\\in\\mathbb R^\\Omega\\;\\exists E\\in\\mathcal F\\;\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{PathIntegral}_t(I_\\mu,\\mu,\\Omega)\n\\land\\operatorname{ItoDyadicIntegral}_t(I_\\sigma,\\sigma,B,\\Omega,\\mathbb P)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land E=\\{w\\in\\Omega:X_t(w)\\neq X_0(w)+I_\\mu(w)+I_\\sigma(w)\\}\n\\land\\mathbb P(E)=0\\Bigr)\\Bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\to\\forall t\\in T\\;\\exists J_1,J_2,J_3\\in\\mathbb R^\\Omega\\;\\exists E\\in\\mathcal F\\;\\Bigl[\n\\operatorname{PathIntegral}_t(J_1,H_1,\\Omega)\n\\land\\operatorname{ItoDyadicIntegral}_t(J_2,H_2,B,\\Omega,\\mathbb P)\n\\land\\operatorname{PathIntegral}_t(J_3,H_3,\\Omega)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{12mm}\\land E=\\{w\\in\\Omega:f(X_t(w))\\neq f(X_0(w))+J_1(w)+J_2(w)+\\tfrac12J_3(w)\\}\n\\land\\mathbb P(E)=0\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}itokobayashi}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{BrownianWithFiltration}_S(B,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,\\mathbb P)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(X,T,\\mathbb R^\\Omega)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\mu,T,\\mathbb R^\\Omega)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\sigma,T,\\mathbb R^\\Omega)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Adapted}_S(X,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,T,\\Omega)\n\\land\\mathrm{Adapted}_S(\\mu,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,T,\\Omega)\n\\land\\mathrm{Adapted}_S(\\sigma,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,T,\\Omega)\n\\land\\forall w\\in\\Omega\\;\\mathrm{ContinuousPath}_S(X,w)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{TwiceContinuouslyDifferentiable}_S(f)\n\\land\\mathrm{Measurable}_S(\\widehat\\mu;(T\\times\\Omega,\\mathcal B_T\\otimes\\mathcal F),(\\mathbb R,\\mathcal B_{\\mathbb R}))\n\\land\\mathrm{Predictable}_S(\\widehat\\sigma,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb R,\\mathcal B_{\\mathbb R})\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall t\\in T\\;\\Bigl[\n\\mathrm{DyadicLTwoApproximation}_S(\\sigma,t,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\n\\land\\mathrm{DyadicLTwoApproximation}_S(H_2,t,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall w\\in\\Omega\\;\\exists a\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\;\n\\mathrm{TimeIntegralValue}_S\\!\\left(a,\\{\\langle s,\\sigma_s(w)^2\\rangle:s\\in[0,t]\\},t\\right)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\exists I_\\mu,I_\\sigma\\in\\mathbb R^\\Omega\\;\\exists E\\in\\mathcal F\\;\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{PathIntegral}_t(I_\\mu,\\mu,\\Omega)\n\\land\\operatorname{ItoDyadicIntegral}_t(I_\\sigma,\\sigma,B,\\Omega,\\mathbb P)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land E=\\{w\\in\\Omega:X_t(w)\\neq X_0(w)+I_\\mu(w)+I_\\sigma(w)\\}\n\\land\\mathbb P(E)=0\\Bigr)\\Bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\to\\forall t\\in T\\;\\exists J_1,J_2,J_3\\in\\mathbb R^\\Omega\\;\\exists E\\in\\mathcal F\\;\\Bigl[\n\\operatorname{PathIntegral}_t(J_1,H_1,\\Omega)\n\\land\\operatorname{ItoDyadicIntegral}_t(J_2,H_2,B,\\Omega,\\mathbb P)\n\\land\\operatorname{PathIntegral}_t(J_3,H_3,\\Omega)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{12mm}\\land E=\\{w\\in\\Omega:f(X_t(w))\\neq f(X_0(w))+J_1(w)+J_2(w)+\\tfrac12J_3(w)\\}\n\\land\\mathbb P(E)=0\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>原公式使用二进网格左端和的平方均值极限，不能不加限制地当作一般局部 Itô 积分。新增假设直接约束被积过程及其二进阶梯逼近，并没有把待证随机积分的存在作为前提。</li>\n<li>连续路径及逐路径有限漂移／平方波动积分使两个确定性链式修正项有逐路径意义。滤过独立性另行明示。</li>\n<li>事件 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\">\\(E\\)</span> 与三个积分见证现在处于同一个存在量词作用域；不再通过 Assertion 外的 “where” 补定义。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch14/58-df-brownian-motion.md","status":"resolved","id":"948f8f3178040b74","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-brownian-motion.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-adapted.md","status":"resolved","id":"6493b2eeaa7f968f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-adapted.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/5