"targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{Adapted}$ 取 [[58-df-adapted.md]] 的同名定义与参数次序。","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"bbbec05fde1d3b01","anchor":"ref-12","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{Measurable}$ 取 [[../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md]] 的同名定义与参数次序。","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-zfc-prob-brownian-motion-process.md","status":"resolved","id":"a8a0a7253619eec2","anchor":"ref-13","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{ContinuousPath}$ 取 [[../batch07/58-df-zfc-prob-brownian-motion-process.md]] 的同名定义与参数次序。","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-predictable.md","status":"resolved","id":"7934599233a4e10f","anchor":"ref-14","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{Predictable}$ 取 [[../batch11/58-df-predictable.md]] 的同名定义与参数次序。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"T=\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}","display":false},{"tex":"B,X,\\mu,\\sigma,f,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,t\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"T\\to\\mathbb R^\\Omega","display":false},{"tex":"X_s(w)=X(s)(w)","display":false},{"tex":"\\widehat H=\\mathrm{JointProcessGraph}_S(H,\\Omega)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal B_T=\\{A\\cap T:A\\in\\mathcal B_{\\mathbb R}\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal B_T\\otimes\\mathcal F=\\sigma_{T\\times\\Omega}(\\{A\\times E:A\\in\\mathcal B_T\\land E\\in\\mathcal F\\})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal B_{\\mathbb R},\\lambda_t","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TwiceContinuouslyDifferentiable}_S(f)","display":false},{"tex":"f'=D(f)","display":false},{"tex":"f''=D(D(f))","display":false},{"tex":"H_1=\\{\\langle s,\\{\\langle w,f'(X_s(w))\\mu_s(w)\\rangle:w\\in\\Omega\\}\\rangle:s\\in T\\}","display":false},{"tex":"H_2=\\{\\langle s,\\{\\langle w,f'(X_s(w))\\sigma_s(w)\\rangle:w\\in\\Omega\\}\\rangle:s\\in T\\}","display":false},{"tex":"H_3=\\{\\langle s,\\{\\langle w,f''(X_s(w))\\sigma_s(w)^2\\rangle:w\\in\\Omega\\}\\rangle:s\\in T\\}","display":false},{"tex":"t","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DyadicStep}_S","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\omega,t\\in T,H\\in(\\mathbb R^\\Omega)^T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DyadicBrownianSum}_S","display":false},{"tex":"B\\in(\\mathbb R^\\Omega)^T","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ItoDyadicIntegral}_t","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal F","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BrownianWithFiltration}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PathwiseTimeIntegral}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RandomSquareNormValue}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RealRandomVariable}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TimeIntegralValue}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TimeSquareNormValue}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Adapted}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Measurable}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ContinuousPath}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Predictable}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DyadicLTwoApproximation}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{DyadicStep}_S(n,t,H,\\Omega)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\\left\\langle\\langle s,w\\rangle,\n\\sum_{k<2^n}H\\!\\left(\\frac{kt}{2^n}\\right)(w)\n\\mathbf1_{(kt/2^n,(k+1)t/2^n]}(s)\\right\\rangle:s\\in T\\land w\\in\\Omega\\right\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{DyadicBrownianSum}_S(n,t,H,B,\\Omega)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\\left\\langle w,\\sum_{k<2^n}H\\!\\left(\\frac{kt}{2^n}\\right)(w)\n\\left[B\\!\\left(\\frac{(k+1)t}{2^n}\\right)(w)-B\\!\\left(\\frac{kt}{2^n}\\right)(w)\\right]\\right\\rangle:w\\in\\Omega\\right\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{PathIntegral}_t(I,H,\\Omega)\n\\leftrightarrow t\\in T\\land\\mathrm{Function}(H,T,\\mathbb R^\\Omega)\n\\land\\mathrm{PathwiseTimeIntegral}_S(I,\\widehat H,t,\\Omega).","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{ItoDyadicIntegral}_t(J,H,B,\\Omega,\\mathbb P)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&t\\in T\\land\\operatorname{ProbabilitySpace}(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(H,T,\\mathbb R^\\Omega)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(B,T,\\mathbb R^\\Omega)\n\\land\\mathrm{RealRandomVariable}_S(J,\\Omega,\\mathcal F)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\\exists N\\in\\omega\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\setminus N\\;\n\\exists r\\in[0,\\varepsilon)\\;\\mathrm{RandomSquareNormValue}_S\\left(r,\n\\{\\langle w,J(w)-\\mathrm{DyadicBrownianSum}_S(n,t,H,B,\\Omega)(w)\\rangle:w\\in\\Omega\\},\n\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P\\right).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{DyadicLTwoApproximation}_S(H,t,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&t\\in T\\land\\mathrm{Function}(H,T,\\mathbb R^\\Omega)\n\\land\\forall s\\in T\\;\\mathrm{RealRandomVariable}_S(H(s),\\Omega,\\mathcal F)\\\\\n&\\land\\exists r\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\;\\mathrm{TimeSquareNormValue}_S(r,\\widehat H,t,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\\exists N\\in\\omega\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\setminus N\\;\n\\exists r\\in[0,\\varepsilon)\\;\\mathrm{TimeSquareNormValue}_S\\left(r,\n\\{\\langle\\langle s,w\\rangle,\\mathrm{DyadicStep}_S(n,t,H,\\Omega)(\\langle s,w\\rangle)-H(s)(w)\\rangle:\ns\\in T\\land w\\in\\Omega\\},t,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P\\right).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}itokobayashi}\\vdash{}&\n\\mathrm{BrownianWithFiltration}_S(B,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,\\mathbb P)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(X,T,\\mathbb R^\\Omega)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\mu,T,\\mathbb R^\\Omega)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\sigma,T,\\mathbb R^\\Omega)\\\\\n&\\land\\mathrm{Adapted}_S(X,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,T,\\Omega)\n\\land\\mathrm{Adapted}_S(\\mu,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,T,\\Omega)\n\\land\\mathrm{Adapted}_S(\\sigma,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,T,\\Omega)\n\\land\\forall w\\in\\Omega\\;\\mathrm{ContinuousPath}_S(X,w)\\\\\n&\\land\\mathrm{TwiceContinuouslyDifferentiable}_S(f)\n\\land\\mathrm{Measurable}_S(\\widehat\\mu;(T\\times\\Omega,\\mathcal B_T\\otimes\\mathcal F),(\\mathbb R,\\mathcal B_{\\mathbb R}))\n\\land\\mathrm{Predictable}_S(\\widehat\\sigma,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb R,\\mathcal B_{\\mathbb R})\\\\\n&\\land\\forall t\\in T\\;\\Bigl[\n\\mathrm{DyadicLTwoApproximation}_S(\\sigma,t,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\n\\land\\mathrm{DyadicLTwoApproximation}_S(H_2,t,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\forall w\\in\\Omega\\;\\exists a\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\;\n\\mathrm{TimeIntegralValue}_S\\!\\left(a,\\{\\langle s,\\sigma_s(w)^2\\rangle:s\\in[0,t]\\},t\\right)\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\exists I_\\mu,I_\\sigma\\in\\mathbb R^\\Omega\\;\\exists E\\in\\mathcal F\\;\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{PathIntegral}_t(I_\\mu,\\mu,\\Omega)\n\\land\\operatorname{ItoDyadicIntegral}_t(I_\\sigma,\\sigma,B,\\Omega,\\mathbb P)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land E=\\{w\\in\\Omega:X_t(w)\\neq X_0(w)+I_\\mu(w)+I_\\sigma(w)\\}\n\\land\\mathbb P(E)=0\\Bigr)\\Bigr]\\\\\n&\\to\\forall t\\in T\\;\\exists J_1,J_2,J_3\\in\\mathbb R^\\Omega\\;\\exists E\\in\\mathcal F\\;\\Bigl[\n\\operatorname{PathIntegral}_t(J_1,H_1,\\Omega)\n\\land\\operatorname{ItoDyadicIntegral}_t(J_2,H_2,B,\\Omega,\\mathbb P)\n\\land\\operatorname{PathIntegral}_t(J_3,H_3,\\Omega)\\\\\n&\\hspace{12mm}\\land E=\\{w\\in\\Omega:f(X_t(w))\\neq f(X_0(w))+J_1(w)+J_2(w)+\\tfrac12J_3(w)\\}\n\\land\\mathbb P(E)=0\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"E","display":false}],"bytes":7246,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4239","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-thm-itokobayashi.md|58-thm-itokobayashi]]（batch04）"}],"outgoing":["948f8f3178040b74","6493b2eeaa7f968f","36d7463d215be751","b91a21e76d0947e0","7934599233a4e10f","a8a0a7253619eec2","6ad876d2c15e685f","e03c77e7d23896d9","bbbec05fde1d3b01"]}